/* 新手导览。类名都带 tour- 前缀：预览渲染器没有样式隔离。压暗用圈的超大阴影（圈本身是透明的，下面的东西亮着看得见）；
   换一步时整层淡一下，圈和卡片位置直接到（不跟着滑，长辈看着不晕） */
.tour {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 9000;
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 0.2s;
}

.tour-ready {
  opacity: 1;
}

.tour-dim {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  background: rgba(30, 26, 20, 0.62);
}

.tour-hole {
  position: absolute;
  border-radius: 24rpx;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4000rpx rgba(30, 26, 20, 0.62);
}

/* 圈外一圈白光一呼一吸，看得出是这儿 */
.tour-hole::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: -6rpx;
  top: -6rpx;
  right: -6rpx;
  bottom: -6rpx;
  border: 4rpx solid #fff;
  border-radius: 28rpx;
  animation: tour-glow 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes tour-glow {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 0.9; transform: scale(1); }
  50% { opacity: 0.35; transform: scale(1.03); }
}

.tour-tip {
  position: absolute;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: 32rpx 36rpx 28rpx;
  border-radius: 28rpx;
  background: #fffdf8;
  box-shadow: 0 12rpx 40rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
}

.tour-arrow {
  position: absolute;
  width: 0;
  height: 0;
  border-left: 24rpx solid transparent;
  border-right: 24rpx solid transparent;
}

.tour-arrow-up {
  top: -22rpx;
  border-bottom: 24rpx solid #fffdf8;
}

.tour-arrow-down {
  bottom: -22rpx;
  border-top: 24rpx solid #fffdf8;
}

.tour-count {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #8a8174;
}

.tour-title {
  margin-top: 8rpx;
  font-size: 40rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #2f2a24;
}

.tour-text {
  margin-top: 12rpx;
  font-size: 34rpx;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: #3f3830;
}

.tour-actions {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  margin-top: 28rpx;
}

.tour-skip {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  white-space: nowrap;
  padding: 16rpx 28rpx;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  color: #8a8174;
}

.tour-next {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  white-space: nowrap;
  margin-left: 16rpx;
  padding: 18rpx 48rpx;
  border-radius: 44rpx;
  background: #4e7d5b;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 34rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  transition: transform 0.15s;
}

.tour-next-press {
  transform: scale(0.96);
}
